# CODEOWNERS - mandatory human review on the two categories where blast radius
# is real: the dangerous 5% surfaces, and the test/harness files (so an
# implementer cannot quietly weaken the tests it is checked against). The boring
# 95% has no owner - the team self-merges freely once CI is green.
#
# Scaffolded by /bootstrap from the project profile (Part B). The owner lines
# below are generated from the dangerous-path globs.
#
# IMPORTANT (this repo's setup): without branch protection enabled, CODEOWNERS
# AUTO-REQUESTS the owner's review and labels the PR, but does NOT block merge.
# To make owner review a hard gate, enable branch protection with "Require
# review from Code Owners" - see docs/BRANCH_PROTECTION_NOTES.md. On a Free
# private repo this requires upgrading the GitHub plan.

# --- Dangerous 5% surfaces -> @marketersatzyra ---
**/.env @marketersatzyra
**/.env.* @marketersatzyra
**/*secret* @marketersatzyra
services/api/**/config.py @marketersatzyra
services/api/**/settings.py @marketersatzyra
services/api/routes/songs.py @marketersatzyra
services/api/**/storage.py @marketersatzyra
workers/**/storage*.py @marketersatzyra
workers/render.py @marketersatzyra
services/api/planner/validate.py @marketersatzyra
.github/workflows/** @marketersatzyra

# --- Test and harness files -> @marketersatzyra ---
**/conftest.py @marketersatzyra
**/*.test.ts @marketersatzyra
**/*.test.tsx @marketersatzyra
vitest.config.* @marketersatzyra
pytest.ini @marketersatzyra

# Everything else: no owner, team self-merges on green CI.
